## 🗄️ Database Schema

### Core Tables

#### `accounts` Table

```sql
CREATE TABLE accounts (
  id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
  user_id UUID REFERENCES profiles(id),
  account_type_id INTEGER REFERENCES account_types(id),
  account_number VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL UNIQUE,
  capital DECIMAL NOT NULL,                    -- Gross investment amount
  transaction_date TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,       -- Investment start date
  end_date TIMESTAMPTZ,                        -- Investment maturity date
  status VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,                 -- 'active', 'mature', 'closed', 'redeemed'
  is_rollover BOOLEAN,                         -- Rollover account flag
  parent_account_id INTEGER,                   -- Reference to parent account
  admin_fee_applied BOOLEAN,                   -- Whether admin fee was charged
  rollover_sequence INTEGER,                   -- Rollover generation number
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,
  updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL
);
```

#### `mutations` Table (Redemption Tracking)

```sql
CREATE TABLE mutations (
  id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
  account_id INTEGER REFERENCES accounts(id),
  type VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,                   -- 'redemption', 'investment', etc.
  amount DECIMAL NOT NULL,                     -- Transaction amount
  description TEXT,                            -- Transaction description
  status VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,                 -- 'completed', 'pending', 'failed'
  transaction_date TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,       -- When the transaction occurred
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,            -- When record was created
  updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL
);
```

#### `fix_rate_accounts` Table

```sql
CREATE TABLE fix_rate_accounts (
  id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
  account_id INTEGER REFERENCES accounts(id),
  annual_rate DECIMAL NOT NULL,               -- Annual interest rate
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,
  updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL
);
```

### Key Relationships

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[profiles] --> B[accounts]
    B --> C[fix_rate_accounts]
    B --> D[parent_account_id]
    D --> B
    E[account_types] --> B
    B --> F[mutations]
    F --> |redemption tracking| B
```

